    "text": "By Staff Report ,\n7 hours ago A 75-year-old Villager was arrested at Colony Plaza after a deputy discovered he was wanted on an outstanding warrant. Robert Dwight Redmond of the Village of Duval was in the parking lot at Publix at about 6:15 p.m. Tuesday when a Sumter County sheriff’s deputy made contact with him in reference to a call for service. Read full article\n4",
